nk=epic">Epic Tier List<!-- --> →</a></header><p class="text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed">At Epic rank, Alucard holds a <strong class="text-text-primary">49.40<!-- -->%</strong> win rate (+1.06% vs all-rank average), is picked in <strong class="text-text-primary">1.09<!-- -->%</strong> of games, and banned in <strong class="text-text-primary">1.18<!-- -->%</strong> of Epic drafts.</p></article><article class="group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]" style="background:linear-gradient(to bottom, #4dc9f6, #4dc9f633);box-shadow:0 0 12px -2px #4dc9f680"></span><header class="mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap"><h3 class="flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]"><span class="inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center" style="color:#4dc9f6;background:#4dc9f61a;border:1px solid #4dc9f640">Legend</span><span>Alucard Win Rate in Legend</span></h3><a class="text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/tier-list?rank=legend">Legend Tier List<!-- --> →</a></header><p class="text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed">At Legend rank, Alucard holds a <strong class="text-text-primary">48.76<!-- -->%</strong> win rate (+0.42% vs all-rank average), is picked in <strong class="text-text-primary">1.14<!-- -->%</strong> of games, and banned in <strong class="text-text-primary">0.66<!-- -->%</strong> of Legend drafts.</p></article><article class="group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30"><span aria-hidden="true" class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]" style="background:linear