cond instead of hard carrying jungle tempo.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Brute Force Breastplate\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Vengeance Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Endless Battle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Endless Battle (2,330 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Brute Force Breastplate\",\"text\":\"Purchase Brute Force Breastplate (1,870 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Bruiser Flex build for Alucard.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard#build-exp-bruiser-flex\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/alucard\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-07T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":7,\"name\":\"Alucard\",\"slug\":\"alucard\",\"title\":\"Demon Hunter\",\"role\":[\"Fighter\",\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":50,\"offense\":50,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":30},\"winRate\":48.08,\"pickRate\":0.99,\"banRate\":0.49,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"harley\",\"heroName\":\"Harley\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Alucard has great chase abilities and damage resistance, making him powerful against squishy Assassins like Harley and Aamon.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"aamon\",\"heroName\":\"Aamon\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Alucard has great chase abilities and damage resistance, making him powerful against squishy Assassins like Harley and Aamon.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"But he can be countered by heroes with powerful control abilities like Franco and Johnson. If controlled, Alucard won't be able to steal HP\\nand can be easily eliminated.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"johnson\",\"heroName\":\"Johnson\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"But he can be countered by heroes with powerful control abilities like Franco and Johnson. If controlled, Alucard won't be able to steal HP\\nand can be easily eliminated.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_c9a8a8b1bb1fed4190f3168d44810ce3.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0f51b6906e08897aa02330d65b0deeac.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"Mages like Kagura or Aurora are ideal partners, Having a good disable allows you to deal more damage to the enemy. Since Mages usually require someone to deal a decent amount of damage early game to farm faster.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"18\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a05a03db633cc03ef3f733d2786073c4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Heroes with Low burst skills, Usually Tanks and Fighters, with his Lifesteal abilities, he can pretty much 1v1 and even 1v2 enemies with ease so long as he doesn’t encounter any Hard CCs *Making myself clear, Burst as in ONE HIT WONDERS LIKE EUDORA* Fighters generally has very consistent high damage throughout like Marksmans.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"8\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/1691dbbde8237768590768a90510d5a6.jpg?w=100-100-f7fcc4\",\"tip\":\"Karina, You won’t be able to hit her when she procs “1” so yeah basically you can only use your skills to pop her. Pretty much allows her to avoid about ⅓ of your full damage.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Pursuit\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"After each skill cast, Alucard's next Basic Attack allows him to dash to the target and deal (+125% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage.\\n\\nDemon Hunter: Alucard deals 110% damage to creeps.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After each skill cast, Alucard's next Basic Attack allows him to dash to the target and deal \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+125% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Demon Hunter\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Alucard deals 110% damage to creeps.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_51d252e4e734a49c0a8a2a00a8ba99b4.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Groundsplitter\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Alucard jumps to the target area and slashes, dealing 270 (+85% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within the area and slowing them by 40% for 2s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Alucard jumps to the target area and slashes, dealing 270\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+85% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies within the area and slowing them by 40% for 2s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8.5s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7862dada550b5e9258bbefafee78a296.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Whirling Smash\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Alucard launches a whirling slash, dealing 345 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Alucard launches a whirling slash, dealing 345\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to nearby enemies.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f9a0e6ddbddbf009ebb0736e320170fa.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Fission Wave\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Passive: Alucard permanently gains 10% Hybrid Lifesteal.\\n\\nActive: Alucard absorbs the energy of enemies in the target area, reducing their Movement Speed by 30% and Hybrid Defense by 10. He gains 10 Hybrid Defense for each enemy hero hit and reduces the cooldown of his other skills to 50% for 6s.\\n\\nUse Again: Alucard releases a powerful shockwave forward, dealing 400 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Passive\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Alucard permanently gains 10% Hybrid Lifesteal.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Active\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Alucard absorbs the energy of enemies in the target area, reducing their Movement Speed by 30% and Hybrid Defense by 10. He gains 10 Hybrid Defense for each enemy hero hit and reduces the cooldown of his other skills to 50% for 6s.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Again\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Alucard releases a powerful shockwave forward, dealing 400\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}],\"cooldown\":\"40s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d4325e672bb7b7a1add8501525684e19.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Burst\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max “2” first, for more sustain damage.\\nSince leveling “1” only increases your damage, the distance of the jump doesn’t increase, you can level this slowly.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max “2” first, for more sustain damage.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Since leveling “1” only increases your damage, the distance of the jump doesn’t increase, you can level this slowly. \"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"gatotkaca\",\"heroName\":\"Gatotkaca\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"He's best with heroes with crowd control, such as Gatotkaca and Xavier, which makes up for his lack of powerful control abilities.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"xavier\",\"heroName\":\"Xavier\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"He's best with heroes with crowd control, such as Gatotkaca and Xavier, which makes up for his lack of powerful control abilities.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Alucard can cast his ULTIMATE to increase Lifesteal and mark enemies and then switch between 1st Skill and 2nd Skill\\r\\nto follow Basic Attacks. Finally, use his ULTIMATE again\\r\\nfor reaping kills.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d4325e672bb7b7a1add8501525684e19.png\"},{\"skillId\":700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7862dada550b5e9258bbefafee78a296.png\"},{\"skillId\":700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f9a0e6ddbddbf009ebb0736e320170fa.png\"},{\"skillId\":700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d4325e672bb7b7a1add8501525684e19.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Alucard can use his 1st Skill to deal damage and slow enemies first, and follow it with Basic Attacks for strikes. Then, he can use his 2nd Skill and follow it with Basic Attacks for more strikes.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7862dada550b5e9258bbefafee78a296.png\"},{\"skillId\":700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"},{\"skillId\":720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f9a0e6ddbddbf009ebb0736e320170fa.png\"},{\"skillId\":700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Alucard build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Learn jungle timing, EXP flex strategy, emblem setups, and when hard CC makes the pick fail.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Alucard is a lifesteal skirmisher, not a blind carry button. He wins when the enemy draft lets him chain skills into passive dashes without being pinned, and he looks ordinary when every entrance gets answered by suppression, knockups, or burst before his sustain starts working.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"alucard\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-07\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-sustain-default\",\"name\":\"Jungle Sustain Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\",\"cost\":2330,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"queens-wings\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"ma