and darkness. As a child, he witnessed the destruction of his village by demonic forces and was left for dead. Rescued and raised by the Moniyan Empire's demon-hunting order, he trained obsessively until his sword became an extension of his will. His relentless pursuit of demons eventually led him to discover a dark truth: the demonic blood flowing through his own veins grants him supernatural strength. Now Alucard must master both his human discipline and his demon heritage to protect the realm he swore to defend.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"relationship\":\"Moniyan commander who oversees the demon hunters\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"granger\",\"heroName\":\"Granger\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow demon hunter and brother in arms\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"alice\",\"heroName\":\"Alice\",\"relationship\":\"Blood queen and sworn enemy of demon hunters\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"dyrroth\",\"heroName\":\"Dyrroth\",\"relationship\":\"Abyssal prince whose darkness mirrors his own\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Alucard\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":49.08,\"pickRate\":0.49,\"banRate\":0.43},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":49.03,\"pickRate\":0.48,\"banRate\":0.42},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":48.89,\"pickRate\":0.49,\"banRate\":0.39},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":48.13,\"pickRate\":0.49,\"banRate\":0.27},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":48.16,\"pickRate\":0.49,\"banRate\":0.27},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":47.15,\"pickRate\":0.67,\"banRate\":0.33},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":48.08,\"pickRate\":0.99,\"banRate\":0.49}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Alucard\",\"heroSlug\":\"alucard\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":48.08,\"pickRate\":0.99,\"banRate\":0.49,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabDa