,null,{\"className\":\"relative content-lazy lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(230px,24%,300px)] lg:gap-x-6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start\",\"style\":{\"top\":128},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7e\",null,{\"target\":\"#hero-article\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"hero-article\",\"className\":\"relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Lock him when the fight will break open\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Alucard is correct when the enemy lineup has reachable damage dealers and limited hard control. He wants a game where the first engage scatters the fight, one enemy carry steps into dash range, and the next few seconds become a chase instead of a front-line wall.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"That makes him much better as a last rotation jungle pick than as an early comfort lock. Pick him into immobile marksmen, greedy mages, and bruisers who want extended side fights. Avoid him when the enemy has multiple point-and-click stops, especially Franco, Kaja, Saber, Khufra, Tigreal, or Barats. Those heroes do not have to outdamage Alucard. They only have to interrupt the commit window and force him to stand still.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The ranked trap is mistaking sustain for permission. Alucard can win ugly two-versus-two fights, but he cannot start clean five-versus-five fights by himself. If your roam has reliable engage and your mid can cover river first, he has space to farm, invade, and punish isolated targets. If your team has no front line and the enemy has layered crowd control, choose a jungler with safer objective access.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"EXP Alucard is a fallback, not the main plan. It works when your team already has a fast jungle core and needs a side-lane duelist who can enter second. It fails when the lane opponent can freeze early waves, buy anti-heal, and force him to spend Groundsplitter just to collect farm.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$